Use system GTest instead of the bundled copy and register the test with
CTest.  Build and install a shared SPIRV-Reflect library, use standard
GNU installation directories, and keep the static library optional.
--- ../CMakeLists.txt	2026-10-02 14:10:40.754366161 +0300
